{
 "encounter_id": "00790",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Morning, doctor. I'm Lorraine, Tyler's foster carer. He's sixteen, and he's got a rash that won't go away. He won't say much, so I'll help."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello Tyler, hello Lorraine. Tyler, tell me about the rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Itchy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Under his watch strap, on his left wrist, and around his belly button, where his jeans button rubs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tyler, when did you notice it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And his ear lobes were red and weeping, after he got the new piercings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else? Blisters?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Some. On my wrist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or has it spread to your face, or inside your mouth?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it ooze, is there any yellow crust, or does it hurt more than itch?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "A bit of crusting on the wrist, but it's mostly itchy. No yellow pus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any history of skin trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He had eczema as a little boy. He has asthma, and hay fever too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does he take any tablets? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No. Nothing regular. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse and temperature. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 70, temperature 36.7, blood pressure 114 over 70, oxygen 99 percent.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathing trouble, wheeze?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any cough or tight chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at the wrist.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's a sharply defined red patch on the underside of the wrist exactly where the watch back sits, with small blisters and a little crusting, and a similar patch near the navel, and the ear lobes are red and scaly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "What is it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The distribution fits nickel, which is in the metal of the watch back, belt buckles, jean buttons, and cheap earrings. I'd say contact dermatitis from nickel."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "A reaction to the metal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. The skin reacts every time it touches nickel. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So no jewellery? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nickel-free jewellery, surgical steel or titanium, and cover the back of the watch with clear nail varnish, or switch to a plastic strap."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to confirm it with patch testing, where we tape small samples of metals to your back for two days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Where do we go? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The dermatology department. I'd also like to take a swab from the crusted wrist, to check it isn't infected."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Use a plain moisturiser a few times a day, and don't scratch."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll keep an eye on him. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the rash looks yellow, weepy, or you see a fever, come back the same day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
